=\"_blank\"><span>化工学子说</span></a></span></p></section><section><p><span>☞<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzIyMTEyNjkxMg==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2290273866113581060#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>化工服务说</span></a></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a96a46ab8e591ac2cb8b353d1c229e5c9bc3f8987803304d4cef9f6064d63573","textLength":1955,"sourceSha256":"9a70bd59c94d437fa5d59ff60dba2e7d76df5a73e00be42f66313eebe6f25026","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5618405d212372443bd0","title":"2026年南京工业大学化工学院2026年江苏省研究生“筑梦化工”暑期学校招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:01.924782+00:00"}
